<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 9,446 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 5,000 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  230   (175 and 161)</p>
<p>    Good		130   (125 and 135)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     120   (117 and 120)</p>
<p>    Medium	    110   (109 and  98)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 95   ( 90 and  88)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 230 pence for a Burundi PD.</p>
</text>
